{%- comment -%}
  chaos_unleashed_master.liquid
  Version:      1.1.0
  Last updated: 2026-05-17
  Branch:       feature/repo-structure

  Purpose:
    Orchestrator for the 7 independent chaos_unleashed performance snippets.
    Renders sub-snippets in the correct load order.

    Replace these 7 individual calls in layout/theme.liquid:
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_performance_deferrer' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_hitbox_suspend' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_third_party_defer' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_hero_video_defer' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_font_preload' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_lcp_preload' %}
      {% render 'chaos_unleashed_font_priority' %}

    With this single call:
      {%- render 'chaos_unleashed_master' -%}

  !! NOT INCLUDED — chaos_unleashed_cfh_defer !!
    cfh_defer requires the Chaos_Raw_CFH variable (captured from
    content_for_header) passed as a parameter. It must remain inline
    in theme.liquid immediately after the capture block:

      {%- capture Chaos_Raw_CFH -%}{{ content_for_header }}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- render 'chaos_unleashed_cfh_defer', raw_cfh: Chaos_Raw_CFH -%}

  Load Order (do not reorder without testing):
    1. font_priority        — critical font face declarations
    2. font_preload         — <link rel="preload"> hints for font files
    3. lcp_preload          — <link rel="preload"> hints for LCP image
    4. performance_deferrer — defers non-critical JS/CSS resources
    5. third_party_defer    — defers third-party scripts (apps, chat, reviews)
    6. hitbox_suspend       — suspends interaction handlers until idle
    7. hero_video_defer     — lazy-loads hero section video

  Dependencies:
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_font_priority.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_font_preload.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_lcp_preload.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_performance_deferrer.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_third_party_defer.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_hitbox_suspend.liquid
    snippets/chaos_unleashed_hero_video_defer.liquid
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_font_priority' -%}
